cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "sgotools: Reproducible access to NHTSA Standing General Order crash reports"
abstract: >-
  A Python package for working with the NHTSA Standing General Order (SGO
  2021-01) incident report files on automated driving systems and Level 2
  driver assistance. It pins a dated snapshot with checksums, reads the
  files' inconsistent encodings, harmonises the schema and value changes
  introduced by the third amendment of 16 June 2025, and records every
  filtering choice applied.
type: software
authors:
